{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your vocal chords to conquer a <strong>vertical obstacle course</strong>! Watch as your beautiful <strong>voice converts to real-time speed</strong>. <strong>Jump</strong>, <strong>duck</strong>, and <strong>scream</strong> to reach the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternatively, you can use your keyboard - but that's for babies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endure the climb</strong> and prove that you can <strong>overcome the height</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the<strong> Seklly Screamer Demo,</strong>\u00a0experience the <strong>first</strong> of<strong> nine</strong>\u00a0levels that are offered in the full game! But you probably won't make it past the first anyway...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skelly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are<strong> Skelly</strong>. This morning you rose from the dead too late and missed your alarm clock! It's time you get up and <strong>begin your trek to work</strong>... which isn't included in the demo, but hey what can you do</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Level</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The<strong>\u00a0demo level</strong> is<strong>\u00a0The Graveyard</strong>. This is Skelly's home, and where you begin your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RAGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>louder</strong> you scream, the<strong> faster</strong>\u00a0Skelly runs. So<strong> keep your cool</strong>!\u00a0<strong>Skelly Screamer</strong> is a rage game, but If you <strong>vocally express your rage</strong>, you might\u00a0 cause a <strong>devastating fall</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OBSTACLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The<strong> Skelly Screamer Demo</strong> includes all the obstacles that will be included throughout the full game:<strong> bounce pads</strong>, <strong>conveyer belts</strong>, <strong>enemies</strong>, and <strong>more</strong>! More obstacles may be added in the full game if requested by the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAY WITHOUT A MICROPHONE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Though <strong>Skelly Screamer</strong> is <strong>meant</strong> to be played with a microphone, you may <strong>use standard keyboard controls</strong> in the alternative\u00a0<strong>Keyboard Mode</strong><i>.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Too Easy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835860/c3b38b452e66ee4d7cf68376836b0a5ee3cd72cf.jpg"},{"name":"Something Deeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835860/1666d4c98f48af74fe04da9faad723674460b95d.jpg"},{"name":"Authentic Gamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835860/0312aa4ca14a166ac92e009a1b18c2b7629c978c.jpg"},{"name":"Hung Over","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835860/8f9dde97369d2cfe240086a55f02b87b64584e32.jpg"},{"name":"I'm Screaming And Crying rn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835860/7678106a8c91868d99ac08635646125f6c62fa2f.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835860?t=1751308678","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835860/af75b50f1a03f405dc9bc58eab6a241722105623/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751308678","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835860/d9b2b32bba45c55d1f8482204a9ec9e870f6ad56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751308678","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835860/d9b2b32bba45c55d1f8482204a9ec9e870f6ad56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751308678","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your vocal chords to conquer a <strong>vertical obstacle course</strong>! Watch as your beautiful <strong>voice converts to real-time speed</strong>. <strong>Jump</strong>, <strong>duck</strong>, and <strong>scream</strong> to reach the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternatively, you can use your keyboard - but that's for babies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endure the climb</strong> and prove that you can <strong>overcome the height</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the<strong> Seklly Screamer Demo,</strong>\u00a0experience the <strong>first</strong> of<strong> nine</strong>\u00a0levels that are offered in the full game! But you probably won't make it past the first anyway...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skelly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are<strong> Skelly</strong>. This morning you rose from the dead too late and missed your alarm clock! It's time you get up and <strong>begin your trek to work</strong>... which isn't included in the demo, but hey what can you do</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Level</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The<strong>\u00a0demo level</strong> is<strong>\u00a0The Graveyard</strong>. This is Skelly's home, and where you begin your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RAGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>louder</strong> you scream, the<strong> faster</strong>\u00a0Skelly runs. So<strong> keep your cool</strong>!\u00a0<strong>Skelly Screamer</strong> is a rage game, but If you <strong>vocally express your rage</strong>, you might\u00a0 cause a <strong>devastating fall</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OBSTACLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The<strong> Skelly Screamer Demo</strong> includes all the obstacles that will be included throughout the full game:<strong> bounce pads</strong>, <strong>conveyer belts</strong>, <strong>enemies</strong>, and <strong>more</strong>! More obstacles may be added in the full game if requested by the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAY WITHOUT A MICROPHONE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Though <strong>Skelly Screamer</strong> is <strong>meant</strong> to be played with a microphone, you may <strong>use standard keyboard controls</strong> in the alternative\u00a0<strong>Keyboard Mode</strong><i>.</i></p>","developers":["DoubleDigitGames"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3103630","name":"Skelly Screamer"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835860/3adafb144950ba35991a4c2eb6c74a99d6d47677/header.jpg?t=1751308678","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257159794,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257159794/movie480.mp4?t=1751306906","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257159794/movie_max.mp4?t=1751306906"},"name":"Skelly Screamer Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257159794/1ec5b6ab8149c82ba651c4f0eca97b0869886208/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751306906","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257159794/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1751306906","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257159794/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1751306906"}}],"name":"Skelly Screamer Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</stro